  kind: 1
  title: "\u0110\xEAm nh\xE0 \u2014 ng\xE0y 11 (th\u01B0 gi\xE3n)"
  intro: "\xD4n ki\u1EC3u chill: tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi sai c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng sao. S\xE1ng
    mai tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp m\u1EDBi \"h\u01A1i\" g\u1EAFt h\u01A1n."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 11] T\u1ED1i nay b\u1EA1n 'h\u1ECDc'
      ki\u1EC3u n\xE0o l\xE0 h\u1EE3p l\xFD nh\u1EA5t (theo ngh\u0129a h\xE0i h\u01B0\u1EDBc)?"
    options:
    - "H\u1ECDc b\u1EB1ng c\xE1ch xem review 0.5x"
    - "H\u1ECDc b\u1EB1ng nghe nh\u1EA1c lo-fi + suy ng\u1EABm v\u0169 tr\u1EE5"
    - "H\u1ECDc b\u1EB1ng l\u01B0\u1EDBt feed '5 ph\xFAt' (4 gi\u1EDD)"
    - "H\u1ECDc b\u1EB1ng vi\u1EBFt TODO r\u1ED3i ho\xE0n th\xE0nh... TODO"
    correctIndex: 1
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 11] M\xF3n \u0103n n\xE0o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      coi l\xE0 'v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m buff n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng' khi c\xFA \u0111\xEAm?"
    options:
    - "M\xEC t\xF4m + tr\u1EE9ng + t\u1ED9i l\u1ED7i"
    - "Salad (trong t\u01B0\u1EDFng t\u01B0\u1EE3ng)"
    - "N\u01B0\u1EDBc l\u1ECDc 'tinh khi\u1EBFt' t\u1EEB m\xE1y l\u1ECDc b\u1ECB
      qu\xEAn thay l\xF5i"
    - "K\u1EB9o cao su v\u1ECB deadline"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 11] Khi b\u1EA1n m\u1EDF s\xE1ch ra
      m\xE0 n\xE3o m\u1EDF YouTube, \u0111\xF3 g\u1ECDi l\xE0?"
    options:
    - "Hi\u1EC7n t\u01B0\u1EE3ng song song \u0111a v\u0169 tr\u1EE5"
    - "Multitasking 'th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EB9p'"
    - "T\xEDnh n\u0103ng t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a Gen Z"
    - "L\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\u1ED7i ph\u1EA7n m\u1EC1m"
    correctIndex: 1
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 11] Ch\u1ECDn c\xE2u 'tri\u1EBFt h\u1ECDc'
      \u0111\xFAng nh\u1EA5t cho sinh vi\xEAn:"
    options:
    - "T\xF4i ng\u1EE7 s\u1EDBm \u0111\u1EC3 mai d\u1EADy s\u1EDBm (n\xF3i t\u1EEB
      2h s\xE1ng)"
    - "T\xF4i kh\xF4ng tr\xEC ho\xE3n, t\xF4i ch\u1EC9 t\u1ED1i \u01B0u\u2026 th\u1EDDi
      gian t\u01B0\u01A1ng lai"
    - "T\xF4i l\xE0m xong h\u1EBFt, ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 ch\u01B0a b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u"
    - "T\xF4i h\u1ECDc b\u1EB1ng tr\u1EF1c gi\xE1c (tr\u1EF1c gi\xE1c b\u1EA3o ng\u1EE7)"
    correctIndex: 2
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 11] T\u1EA1i sao highlight m\xE0u v\xE0ng
      l\u1EA1i 'd\u1EC5 nh\u1EDB'?"
    options:
    - "V\xEC n\xE3o th\xEDch m\xE0u x\xE1m c\u1EE7a th\u1EF1c t\u1EA1i"
    - "V\xEC highlighter h\u1EBFt m\u1EF1c nhanh n\xEAn n\xE3o bu\u1ED3n qu\xEAn"
    - "V\xEC gi\xE1o vi\xEAn c\u0169ng th\xEDch v\xE0ng"
    - "V\xEC \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 skill skin premium"
